   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000116",
   "text": "幸好 不然這山崖這麼高 海一定很深 摔下去絕對死定了",
   "audio": "/srv/818data/001_001_000116_000001.wav",
   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000118",
   "text": "我們快點走 走啦",
   "audio": "/srv/818data/001_001_000118_000001.wav",
   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000123",
   "text": "誰要拿錢回去救你媽",
   "audio": "/srv/818data/001_001_000123_000001.wav",
   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000124",
   "text": "大哥  你不是說會把我平安帶回去",
   "audio": "/srv/818data/001_001_000124_000001.wav",
   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000125",
   "text": "你不是說會把我平安帶回去",
   "audio": "/srv/818data/001_001_000125_000001.wav",
   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000126",
   "text": "二哥 你不是說你會跟大哥  一起來參加我的婚禮",
