   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000175",
   "text": "去啊 你去找進輝 讓你媽等死 你去啊",
   "audio": "/srv/818data/001_001_000175_000001.wav",
   "speech_language": "nan"
  },
  {
   "id": "drama-000176",
   "text": "要我眼睜睜 看我的兄弟摔下去 我心裡也很難受",
   "audio": "/srv/818data/001_001_000176_000001.wav",
